---
import Tunnel from '../../../layouts/Tunnel.astro';
---
<Tunnel title="Step 4 — Copy Music Back | Save My Gig!" status="Critical_Path · Recovery" red>
  <div class="step-label">Step 4 of 5</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">Copy music back to the USB</h2>

  <p>This prepares the USB to play again on CDJs.</p>

  <div class="panel panel-warn">
    <p style="margin:0">⚠️ <strong>Do not remove the USB whilst copying.</strong> Interrupting this step may cause data loss.</p>
  </div>

  <p>Copy the tracks from your computer back to the USB. Only transfer what you actually need to perform your set.</p>

  <p class="question">Are the tracks now on the USB?</p>

  <a href="/protocol/critical/load" class="btn btn-go" data-event="step_completed" data-step="copy_back" data-answer="yes">
    🟢 Yes — tracks are on the USB
  </a>
  <a href="/protocol/critical/fallback" class="btn btn-stop" data-event="step_completed" data-step="copy_back" data-answer="no">
    🔴 No — it's not working
  </a>
</Tunnel>
